; ==============================================================
; XAUUSD H1 SWING TREND — ride established trends
; HTF (H4) bias filter + discount/premium pullback entry; no time
; decay; BE lock at 1R; optional 50% partial at 2R; wide ATR trail.
; Use in CLEAR trending gold markets (strong 4h trend days).
; Not for chop. Attach to XAUUSD H1 chart. MODE_SWING is mandatory.
; ==============================================================
